# GenKeyboard local secrets. Copy to the real files listed below; all of them are gitignored.
#
# Backend (Cloudflare Worker):  backend/.dev.vars       <- copy from backend/.dev.vars.example
#   GEMINI_API_KEY=          https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY=      https://openrouter.ai/keys
#   (XAI/OPENAI/ANTHROPIC optional)
#   Production: wrangler secret put <NAME>   (never in wrangler.toml)
#
# Android release signing:      keystore.properties     <- copy from keystore.properties.example
#   Keystore file itself (*.jks) is gitignored too. Back both up outside the repo.
#
# Android SDK path:             local.properties (sdk.dir=...) generated by Android Studio, gitignored.
